B.Je=new A.jo("Nuha Mobile","Nuha Mobile is a healthcare application designed to help hospitals across Indonesia digitize patient services and improve operational efficiency. The app focuses on accessibility, performance, and a seamless patient experience.\n\nCore Features:\n1. Online appointment booking\n2. BPJS status verification\n3. Booking based on control letters\n4. Patient medical record history\n5. Doctor schedules and room availability\n\nTechnical Implementation:\n- Clean Architecture with modular feature separation\n- Bloc & Provider for state management\n- Dependency Injection for scalable development\n- Optimized performance for large-scale users","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nuha.nuha","https://apps.apple.com/id/app/nuha/id6472009062",null,"assets/nuha.png","50k+ Downloads",B.O8,B.OP)
